to capture events when actual data is drawn on the map please refer to Events API"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and listen to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onSourceDataLoaded"},{"text":" (optionally pass the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dataId"},{"text":" parameter to filter the events)","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onMapLoadingError"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"type = metadata"},{"type":"text","text":" if data parsing error has occurred."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Partially updating a GeoJSON source is not compatible with using shared cache and generated IDs."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It is important to ensure that every feature in the GeoJSON style source, as well as the newly added"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"feature, has a unique ID (or a unique promote ID if in use). Failure to provide unique IDs will result"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"in a ","type":"text"},{"code":"map-loading-error","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The method allows the user to provide a data ID, which will be returned as the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dataId"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source-data-loaded"},{"text":" event. However, it’s important to note that multiple partial updates can be queued","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the same GeoJSON source when ongoing source parsing is taking place. In these cases, the partial"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"updates will be applied to the source in batches. Only the data ID provided in the most recent call within"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"each batch will be included in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source-data-loaded"},{"type":"text","text":" event. If no data ID is provided in the most recent"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"call, the data ID in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"source-data-loaded","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"event will be null."}]}],"name":"Note"},{"style":"note","name":"Throws","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.mapbox.MapboxMaps\/documentation\/MapboxMaps\/StyleError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" if there is a problem adding features to the source."}]}],"type":"aside"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/mapboxmaps\/stylemanager\/addgeojsonsourcefeatures(forsourceid:features:dataid:)"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Add additional features to a GeoJSON style source.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.mapbox.MapboxMaps\/documentation\/MapboxMaps\/StyleManager\/addGeoJSONSourceFeatures(forSourceId:features:dataId:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:10MapboxMaps12StyleManagerC24addGeoJSONSourceFeatures11forSourceId8features04dataK0ySS_Say4Turf7FeatureVGSSSgtF","modules":[{"name":"MapboxMaps"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"addGeoJSONSourceFeatures"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"forSourceId","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"features"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Feature","preciseIdentifier":"s:10MapboxMaps7Featurea","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"text":"dataId","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"k